messages[13]{user,text}:
  user_1,[00:00] Hello? Hi, is this Anita from Trust Wealth Advisors? I... I wanted to talk about my health policy.
  user_2,[00:05] Yes, hi Sneha! This is Anita Sharma, how can I help you today?
  user_1,[00:10] Umm, I received a notice that my policy status is... pending? I'm a bit confused.
  user_2,[00:15] Okay, let me pull up your details... [typing]... Got it. Your policy number is HP-2026-0456, right?
  user_1,[00:20] Yeah, that's the one. I was wondering if the pending status means I need to submit any documents.
  user_2,[00:25] Usually pending means we’re waiting on a couple of things—maybe a recent medical report or a claim form. Did you get a request email?
  user_1,[00:30] I think I got an email, but I... I didn't open it yet. [sighs] Can you tell me what exactly is needed?
  user_2,[00:35] Sure. We need your latest blood test results and a signed declaration that you haven’t had any major surgeries in the last year. Also, a copy of your ID.
  user_1,[00:40] Got it. I can send those over. How should I upload them?
  user_2,[00:45] You can upload them through our portal, or email me directly at anita.sharma@trustwealth.com. Whatever’s easier.
  user_1,[00:50] Okay, I’ll do that today. Do I need to do anything else for the policy to be active?
  user_2,[00:55] Once we receive the docs, we’ll review and update the status. Should be active within 2-3 business days. Anything else I can help with?
  user_1,[01:00] No, that's all. Thanks!